{
  "format": "jfn",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Drei Zonen",
  "description": "FW mit den Zonen INNEN (PC1), DMZ (WEB) und AUSSEN (EXT): von innen geht alles hinaus und die Antworten kommen zurueck, von außen kommt nur Web in die DMZ, per Portweiterleitung auf 203.0.113.1:80.",
  "seed": 7,
  "next_id": 9,
  "strict_mdix": false,
  "devices": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "PC1",
      "model": "pc",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "off": false,
      "startup_config": "hostname PC1\nip addr add 192.168.1.10/24 dev eth0\nip route add default via 192.168.1.1\n",
      "services": [],
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "name": "WEB",
      "model": "server-1u",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 200,
      "off": false,
      "startup_config": "hostname WEB\nip addr add 10.0.0.10/24 dev eth0\nip route add default via 10.0.0.1\n",
      "services": [
        {
          "kind": "http-server",
          "name": "web",
          "disabled": false,
          "config": {
            "workers": 4,
            "time_ms": 2,
            "routes": [
              {
                "path": "/",
                "body": "Hallo aus der DMZ, {client} fragt {host}\n"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "EXT",
      "model": "server-1u",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 0,
      "off": false,
      "startup_config": "hostname EXT\nip addr add 203.0.113.10/24 dev eth0\nip route add default via 203.0.113.1\n",
      "services": [
        {
          "kind": "http-server",
          "name": "web",
          "disabled": false,
          "config": {
            "workers": 4,
            "time_ms": 2,
            "routes": [
              {
                "path": "/",
                "body": "Hallo aus dem Internet, {client} fragt {host}\n"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "name": "FW",
      "model": "jf-fw",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 0,
      "off": false,
      "startup_config": "hostname FW\n!\nipv6 unicast-routing\n!\nclass-map type inspect match-any ALLES\n match protocol tcp\n match protocol udp\n match protocol icmp\n!\nclass-map type inspect WEB\n match protocol http\n!\npolicy-map type inspect NACH-AUSSEN\n class type inspect ALLES\n  inspect\n!\npolicy-map type inspect IN-DIE-DMZ\n class type inspect WEB\n  inspect log\n class class-default\n  drop log\n!\nzone security INNEN\n description das Buero\n!\nzone security DMZ\n description der Webserver\n!\nzone security AUSSEN\n!\nzone-pair security I-A source INNEN destination AUSSEN\n service-policy type inspect NACH-AUSSEN\n!\nzone-pair security I-D source INNEN destination DMZ\n service-policy type inspect NACH-AUSSEN\n!\nzone-pair security A-D source AUSSEN destination DMZ\n service-policy type inspect IN-DIE-DMZ\n!\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/0\n ip address 192.168.1.1 255.255.255.0\n ip nat inside\n zone-member security INNEN\n no shutdown\n!\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/1\n ip address 10.0.0.1 255.255.255.0\n ip nat inside\n zone-member security DMZ\n no shutdown\n!\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/2\n ip address 203.0.113.1 255.255.255.0\n ip nat outside\n zone-member security AUSSEN\n no shutdown\n!\nip nat inside source list 1 interface GigabitEthernet0/2 overload\nip nat inside source static tcp 10.0.0.10 80 203.0.113.1 80\n!\naccess-list 1 permit 192.168.1.0 0.0.0.255\n!\nend\n",
      "services": [],
      "comment": ""
    }
  ],
